@falling_nobody_task_HostAddress = http://localhost:5228

### Get all rooms
GET {{falling_nobody_task_HostAddress}}/rooms
Accept: application/json

###

### Get reservations for a specific room (roomId=1)
GET {{falling_nobody_task_HostAddress}}/reservations?roomId=1
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a new reservation
POST {{falling_nobody_task_HostAddress}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "startTime": "2026-01-22T10:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2026-01-22T11:00:00Z"
}

###

### Cancel a reservation (replace {id} with actual reservation ID)
DELETE {{falling_nobody_task_HostAddress}}/reservations/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000
Accept: application/json

###
